\title{Translations of cochains and of their backgrounds}
\date{2026-11-17}

\p{The constant [right actions](fdip-00VK) act separately
at each vertex. A translation also moves the vertex
label. Its interaction with a connection can be read
from the forward and inverse transport formulas.}

